## Per-developer NuGet config. Gitignore developer-dropped NuGet.config
## copies anywhere in the tree — local-feed registration is a one-time
## user-level setup. The repo-root /nuget.config IS checked in and only
## contributes the github-charles8051 source so CI restore works without
## per-developer setup; see the file header for why it deliberately
## skips <clear /> and packageSourceMapping.
NuGet.config
NuGet.Config
nuget.config
!/nuget.config

